  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Update defaultCliVersion to 1.9.0 by @simvlad in https://github.com/temporalio/temporal/pull/12038\n* Fix SAA activity task validation routing by @fretz12 in https://github.com/temporalio/temporal/pull/12206\n* Release/v1.32.x: Preserve and observe task queue user data by @Shivs11 in https://github.com/temporalio/temporal/pull/12278\n* Update defaultCliVersion to 1.9.1 by @chaptersix in https://github.com/temporalio/temporal/pull/12303\n* Bump Server version to 1.32.1 by @chaptersix in https://github.com/temporalio/temporal/pull/12304\n* [v1.32.x] Configure CHASM internal callback namespace binding (#11876) by @davidporter-id-au in https://github.com/temporalio/temporal/pull/12320\n* Backport #12323 to release/v1.32.x by @michaely520 in https://github.com/temporalio/temporal/pull/12328\n* Clear scaleInfo when scaler is disabled (#12026) by @carlydf in https://github.com/temporalio/temporal/pull/12409\n* Make fair task gc conditional on rangeid (#12283) by @carlydf in https://github.com/temporalio/temporal/pull/12411\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/temporalio/temporal/compare/v1.32.0...v1.32.1",
